  "description": "Life is a series of peaks and valleys--the Double Peak collection is ready for all of it! The Double Peak 1 is our all-mountain machine featuring a hydroformed aluminum frame with a tapered head tube, matched with a 120mm travel Rock Shox Judy fork. A Shimano Cues 1 X 11 drivetrain is simple, smooth and efficient. Double wall rims are laced tight with Shimano Center lock hubs with a 12mm Boost rear axle and 15mm front. WTB Trail Boss tires get you down the trail, while Shimano hydraulic disc brakes slow it down at the bottom of the hill. Fun, easy, and won't break the bank. The Double Peak is ready.",
